<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIA BEAT CROATIA 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIA BEAT CROATIA 4-1 IN DAVIS CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SPLIT, Croatia 1996-09-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia beat Croatia 4-1 in their Davis Cup tennis World group qualifying tie after sharing the final singles on Sunday.</p>
<p>Results (Australian names first):</p>
<p>Mark Philippoussis beat Goran Oresic 6-1 6-4</p>
<p>Jason Stoltenberg lost to Sasa Hirszon 2-6 2-6.</p>
</text>
